// Task - Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P464921323" "I just got word that I'm about to have another of these futile retaliation control missions dumped on me by Arbiter Leery, and I am getting sick of it. {VillainName}, it is time to radically alter the paradigm under which we've been working. So far, I've been getting these strange jobs and you've been handling them for me. The second part of that, that's been great. You've been a real pro. No complaints there. No, what we need to shift into a new success-space is the first part. Before I get another one of these little fires to put out, I want to find out who's been throwing matches around. Both the Council and the Freaks said that they were retaliating against Arachnos actions that, as far as I've been able to find, were never authorized. Computer crimes that they were able to trace back to us, and no one should be able to trace our hackers back to us. I'm starting to think that someone's setting Arachnos up to take the blame for their own actions. This means we have a renegade or an infiltrator. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I want to find out who's been doing this, and I want you in on this project. I think I know how to leverage him out into the open, but I'm going to need your help.</A> Otherwise, we're going to be cleaning up these messes for the rest of our careers."
// AcceptString :
"P2331559055" "Help discover the source of the computer attacks"
// SendOffString :
"P1487131979" "Like I said, I have a plan. I heard from a guy I know in the Sky Raiders that there's a Longbow agent with, shall we say, a very open concept of acceptable business opportunities. Word is that this guy has just secured information on the Freaks and the Council. The same info that got them both riled up. Meaning, he's got access to whoever is behind all of this mess. The problem is that I don't know who this rogue guy is, only that he exists. The one who knows is that guy I know in the Raiders. So what you're going to do is find that Raider I was talking about, and get the information out of him. His name's Bruce Braun. I'll tell you where he is, and leave the rest to you. <br><br>Yeah, Bruce is a good guy. I hate to have to do this to him. Or really, to have to have you do this to him. But hey, that's business."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P148980178" "Get info from Bruce Braun"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1420039240" "Bruce was a good friend of mine back in college. Don't know why he ended up in the Sky Raiders. Probably a good story, but I don't know if I'll ever get to hear it after this. Too bad, really."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2096112880" "The Sky Raiders have made quite a base for themselves here. You have to wonder how long it will last before someone like you tears it apart."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_DISPLAYNAME 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2896519621" "Capt. Bruce Braun"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_VILLAIN 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2360170778" "Still no word? Our contact must be lying low."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3542430944" "You won't live long enough to regret this, {VillainName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Brucie 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Description :
"P2835424972" "Catch Cpt. Bruce Braun"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4037808279" "It wasn't pleasant, but you made Capt. Braun talk."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4133961473" "You got the information you needed from Capt. Braun."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3001413286" "Agent Glenn Sampson? Huh. I'll put my people on it. This is how you put yourself on a success-oriented track! It's all about goals. I've always understood that. You just can't let yourself get bogged down by things like old friendships. There, I said it right there. Old friendships. Old means yesterday, and yesterday isn't the place you can stay if you want to succeed. And you and I, we're gonna succeed. The next step is going to be this Agent Sampson. He won't know what hit him. <br><br>Poor Bruce, though. Well, that's the price of doing business, I guess. Hey, and now that hot wife of his might need some comforting in her time of need, if you know what I mean."
// RandomFameString :
"P2278078695" "I heard that there was some kind of excitement at the Sky Raider base, and that {VillainName} was at the center of it."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P243652123" "I did some digging. Turns out that this Agent Sampson gets around. Right now, my sources place him meeting with the Scrapyarders, selling them information about Council operations that matches what was stolen from the Council in that first attack. I gotta admit, he's a real go-getter. A self-starter. I admire his initiative, but what I really want is to learn is who is he getting this information from. We find that out, we find out who's been conducting these attacks and pinning it on Arachnos. And that gets you paid and me promoted. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>The first step is to catch Agent Glenn Sampson.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P4226184575" "Catch Agent Sampson"
// SendOffString :
"P2451021239" "Once you've caught this agent Sampson, find out where and how he gets his information. That should tell us if we have a traitor or a spy inside Arachnos."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound4_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1315187545" "Once you have Sampson, force his source of information out of him, then get it."

